  "ruleText": "Adm 101.01 \"Commissioner\" means the commissioner of administrative services, designated as the chief fiscal planning and control officer of the state under RSA 21-I:1.\n\nSource. #2235, eff 12-30-82; ss by #3032, eff 5-31-85, EXPIRED: 5-31-91\n\nNew. #7087, eff 8-31-99",
